- INDUSTRYNAME: Some industries may have more stable income and job security, affecting credit score positively.  
- PDN (Probability of default number): Lower PDN indicates lower risk, higher credit score.  
- UNDERAGECHILDRENCOUNT: More dependents might strain finances, potentially lower credit score.  
